  {
   "heading": "Consistent circles",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "46edo is home to a number of consistent circles , both ones closing after generating all 46 notes and ones closing after generating 23edo.\nFor the 23rd-octave temperament that 46edo supports which combines all above 23-note circles, see icositritonic ."
  },
