  {
   "heading": "Harmonic scales",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "46edo represents overtones 8 through 16 (written as JI ratios 8:9:10:11:12:13:14:15:16) with degrees 0, 8, 15, 21, 27, 32, 37, 42, 46. This corresponds to scale steps of 8, 7, 6, 6, 5, 5, 5, 4."
  },
