  },
  {
   "heading": "Skip fretting",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Skip fretting system 46 2 11 is a skip fretting system for playing 46-edo on a 23-edo stringed instrument.\nSkip fretting system 46 7 11 is another skip fretting system for 46edo. The examples on this page are for 7-string guitar .\n1/1: string 2 open\n2/1: string 3 fret 5\n3/2: not easily accessible\n5/4: string 5 fret 4"
